\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S30}{\ignorespaces Complete 17-Model Common Support Matrix on Realized FPR $[0.10, 0.50]$ (Strictly Causal Trailing Regime). For each model contrasted against TS-JEPA, common support requires observed test false-positive rates to span $[0.10, 0.50]$ without extrapolation. Supported and discarded streams are out of 19 total non-GHL benchmark streams. Seed cells indicate paired stream--seed runs. $\Delta \mathrm  {pAUC}$: mean paired partial-AUC difference (TS-JEPA minus model) across supported streams; 95\% CI: stream-level bootstrap confidence interval (2,000 resamples); Wilcoxon $p$: two-sided stream-level paired Wilcoxon signed-rank test; FDR $p_{\mathrm  {BH}}$: Benjamini--Hochberg adjusted $p$-value across the 17-model family.}}{12}{table.30}\protected@file@percent }
